00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,489
If it means a different amino acid, it is missense.

2
00:00:03,489 --> 00:00:08,476
G A G to G U G puts valine in place of glutamic acid.

3
00:00:08,476 --> 00:00:15,638
This exact change, at the sixth amino acid of the beta chain of haemoglobin, causes sickle cell anaemia.

